{"seq":3,"slug":"when-not-to-spec","title":"何时不必写规格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/specs-in-practice/when-not-to-spec","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"何时不必写规格\">何时不必写规格</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>规格驱动是强大的杠杆，但杠杆不是用来撬一切的。为每个琐碎改动都写规格，会让方法异化成官僚仪式，最终被整个团队抛弃。成熟的判断标准只有一条：算回报。本节给出一张成本收益账、适用与跳过的场景清单（附 2025–2026 年工具链中的真实先例），以及防止形式化的具体做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>投资而非义务</strong>：写规格是一次决策，判据是回报，而非流程合规。</li>\n<li><strong>成本三项</strong>：想清楚的认知成本、写作与评审的时间成本、以及随存活期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 放大的持续维护成本。</li>\n<li><strong>决策不等式</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>write</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>maintain</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>err</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{write}} + C_{\\text{maintain}} \\cdot T &lt; p_{\\text{err}} \\cdot C_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">write</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">maintain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">err</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成立时写，不成立时果断省略。</li>\n<li><strong>比例原则</strong>：风险与清晰度决定重量——高风险逐步细化，低风险一步到位或直接动手。</li>\n<li><strong>形式化预警</strong>：填模板成为目的、一刀切制度取代判断、拖慢交付却无人质疑、重量不重准。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以下依次给出这笔账、适合规格的场景、该跳过的场景，以及避免沦为形式主义的做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规格的成本收益账\">规格的成本收益账</h2><p>写规格的成本至少有三项：想清楚的认知成本、写作与评审的时间成本、以及最容易被忽略的<strong>持续维护成本</strong>——一份长期存在的活规格要求随代码同步更新，这项开支要乘以它的存活期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。收益则主要来自避免昂贵的错误：防止 agent 跑偏、防止返工、缩短人际对齐。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>write</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>maintain</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>err</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>值得写</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{write}} + C_{\\text{maintain}} \\cdot T \\;&lt;\\; p_{\\text{err}} \\cdot C_{\\text{rework}} \\quad \\Longrightarrow \\quad \\text{值得写}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">write</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">maintain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">err</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">值得写</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>err</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{err}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">err</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是不写规格时出错的概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是出错的返工代价。这个不等式解释了两件直觉事：高风险改动（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>err</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{err}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">err</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大）几乎总是划算；改文案这类低风险小事几乎总是浪费。它还有一个推论：预期存活期很短的产物不值得沉淀规格——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 太小时维护项虽小，沉淀价值也趋零，只剩纯开销。反过来，一旦决定要写，写得含糊比不写更危险——欠定义如何放大返工见<a href=\"../why-spec-driven-with-ai/the-cost-of-underspecification\">含糊规格的代价</a>。</p>\n<p>同时要警惕对「流程必然提效」的乐观估计。METR 在 2025 年发表了一项随机对照实验：16 名资深开源开发者在自己熟悉的项目上使用当时最新的 AI 编码工具，实测完成速度反而慢了约 19%，而他们在实验前后都自我估计会快约 20%（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.09089\">arXiv:2507.09089</a>）。结论不是「工具无用」，而是<strong>人对流程开销的直觉系统性偏乐观</strong>——规格流程的收益应当像这样被测量，而不是被假定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么情况适合规格\">什么情况适合规格</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景特征</th>\n<th>为什么回报高</th>\n<th>工具链先例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心逻辑、数据正确性、对外契约</td>\n<td>出错代价高（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大）</td>\n<td>RFC 2119 式强约束条款用于协议互操作（rfc-editor.org）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求微妙、边界与异常多</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>err</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{err}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">err</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高，规格显著降低误解概率</td>\n<td>Kiro 为 bugfix 设独立规格类型，逐条记录 current / expected / unchanged 行为（kiro.dev/docs/specs）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多人或人机需要对齐</td>\n<td>对齐本身就是规格的主收益</td>\n<td>Spec Kit 的 assess 扩展把想法走完 intake → research → define → shape → decide，输出 go / needs-clarification / kill 三态结论（GitHub Spec Kit）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难回滚、影响面广</td>\n<td>事后纠错贵，前置投入值回票价</td>\n<td>数据库迁移与 API 变更通常强制 design 评审先行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意第三行的先例：连「要不要立项」这种元决策都有证据先行的规格化工作流——规格思维应该用在值得深思的节点上，而不是均匀铺满所有工作（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/spec-kit\">GitHub Spec Kit</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么情况跳过\">什么情况跳过</h2><p>四类场景直接动手更好：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>平凡小改动</strong>：改文案、调样式、加日志——意图一目了然，写规格是纯仪式。主流工具对此的默认路径就是不设门槛：Claude Code 里直接说需求即可执行，plan mode 只是一个可选开关（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/common-workflows\">Claude Code Docs</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>探索性原型</strong>：方向未定时硬写规格，是用想象替代实验。XP 早有对应实践叫 spike solution——为回答一个问题而写、写完即弃的探索代码（<a href=\"http://www.extremeprogramming.org/rules/spike.html\">extremeprogramming.org</a>）。spike 的产出物是答案；答案清晰之后回头补规格，才有内容可写。</li>\n<li><strong>一次性脚本</strong>：用完即弃的代码，正确性靠当场验证，不值得沉淀意图。</li>\n<li><strong>低风险且显然</strong>：心里清楚、错了也无妨——直接做的反馈回路比写读规格都快。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工具链自己也承认比例原则：Kiro 对 well-understood features 提供 Quick Spec，一轮生成全部三个工件、跳过逐阶段审批门（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Kiro Docs: Specs</a>）——连以全流程著称的工具都不认为审批该无差别套用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q1[&quot;出错代价高,或需求容易被误解？&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| SPEC[&quot;写规格&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Q2[&quot;意图显然且风险低？&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| GO[&quot;直接动手&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Q3[&quot;方向还没定？&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| SPIKE[&quot;先跑 spike 探索&lt;br/&gt;方向定了再补规格&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| LIGHT[&quot;轻量形式:&lt;br/&gt;几行验收标准足够&quot;]&#10;    SPEC --&gt; FIT[&quot;形式与风险相称&quot;]&#10;    LIGHT --&gt; FIT\">flowchart TD\n    Q1[\"出错代价高,或需求容易被误解？\"] --&gt;|\"是\"| SPEC[\"写规格\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"否\"| Q2[\"意图显然且风险低？\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"是\"| GO[\"直接动手\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"否\"| Q3[\"方向还没定？\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"是\"| SPIKE[\"先跑 spike 探索&lt;br/&gt;方向定了再补规格\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"否\"| LIGHT[\"轻量形式:&lt;br/&gt;几行验收标准足够\"]\n    SPEC --&gt; FIT[\"形式与风险相称\"]\n    LIGHT --&gt; FIT</pre><h2 id=\"避免沦为形式主义\">避免沦为形式主义</h2><p>规格驱动的失败方式很少是被公开反对，更多是被慢慢掏空——人人照章填模板，没人再信内容。四个预警信号：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>填模板成为目的</strong>：为流程合规而写，而非为防错而写。</li>\n<li><strong>一刀切制度取代判断</strong>：规定所有 PR 必须带规格，把按价值的判断换成按规则的服从——上文的不等式在任何固定阈值下都不会对所有改动成立。</li>\n<li><strong>拖慢交付却无人质疑</strong>：当它开始纯粹消耗时间，就是用过头了的信号。</li>\n<li><strong>重量不重准</strong>：追求大而全的文档却任其过期——又绕回了漂移问题。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>解毒剂是轻量。Nygard 设计 ADR 时刻意把模板压到六节（Title、Date、Status、Context、Decision、Consequences），定位是忙碌工程师的日常工具而非架构委员会的仪式（<a href=\"https://cognitect.com/blog/2011/11/15/documenting-architecture-decisions\">Nygard 原文</a>）。能用一句话说清的就一句话落盘；口头已对齐且无追溯需求的，允许不留痕。从一行式到完整三工件的粒度谱系与选法，见<a href=\"../writing-good-specs/right-sizing-the-spec\">规格的粒度</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>决策口诀：先估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>err</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{err}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">err</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 再动笔——让不等式做主，别让习惯做主。</li>\n<li>给 spike 立规矩：明确它是要扔的，答案到手即弃，防止原型悄悄变成生产代码。</li>\n<li>按风险档位预设模板：一行式、十行式、完整三工件，按需取用，不层层加码。</li>\n<li>定期复盘哪些规格真的拦住了错；拦不住的那部分，说明模板或场景判断该改了。</li>\n<li>允许在 PR 里显式声明「本次不写规格及理由」，让省略成为受控选项而非沉默违规。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>规格是投资而非义务：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>write</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>maintain</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>err</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{write}} + C_{\\text{maintain}} \\cdot T &lt; p_{\\text{err}} \\cdot C_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">write</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">maintain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">err</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成立时写，不成立时果断省略。平凡改动直接做，方向未定先 spike；从 Kiro Quick Spec 到可选的 plan mode，工具链也在为轻量让路。知道何时不写与知道何时写同等重要——它决定规格驱动能否长期活下去。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"何时不必写规格","id":"何时不必写规格"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"规格的成本收益账","id":"规格的成本收益账"},{"level":2,"text":"什么情况适合规格","id":"什么情况适合规格"},{"level":2,"text":"什么情况跳过","id":"什么情况跳过"},{"level":2,"text":"避免沦为形式主义","id":"避免沦为形式主义"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规格作为人机共享契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/specs-in-practice/specs-for-humans-and-agents"},"next":null}